The official compiled binaries for MSDOS (unofficially dropped into wuarchives 
MSDOS_UPLOADS/games directory) works just fine on a 286 system IF you have 2 meg
of memory and an XMS driver (HIMEM.SYS).

If the memory falls below 2 meg the game spends so much time accessing the disk
that it is almost unplayable.

